          "The Lich harvests your souls!"
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:caravan/armory": {
      "key": "bark:caravan/armory",
      "id": "bark-caravan-armory",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:892b7a0547aa574939173c415ffd38c75c9a40526860f9eb620c4b4761d627d1",
      "about": [
        "character-old-hask"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "character-old-hask"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "character-old-hask",
        "context": "caravan: Armory Wagon",
        "lines": [
          "Bring me the dented ones. The shiny ones never have stories.",
          "Concord steel. Good steel, too. Shame about who it was bought with.",
          "Every crack's a lesson. Some lessons are just more expensive."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:caravan/enchanter_wagon": {
      "key": "bark:caravan/enchanter_wagon",
      "id": "bark-caravan-enchanter-wagon",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:e3cb47fbc6377a539acd5e90fcfb6e055a0b54739638dd2134b7e9ecb57bd18a",
      "about": [
        "character-lio"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "character-lio"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "character-lio",
        "context": "caravan: Enchanter's Wagon",
        "lines": [
          "I ground the dust fine as flour. She says it's still too coarse.",
          "She hums while she binds. Not the Choir's tune. Her own.",
          "Bring armor with a story in it. The workings hold tighter."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:caravan/mana_casks": {
      "key": "bark:caravan/mana_casks",
      "id": "bark-caravan-mana-casks",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:bf5ac2674ffa37c6d7e5e6d34db920a27471511bcdbe42069aa52f242e2b79b3",
      "about": [
        "character-brannoc"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "character-brannoc"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "character-brannoc",
        "context": "caravan: Mana Casks",
        "lines": [
          "Casks sloshing fine today. Mind you don't sit on the blue one.",
          "These casks came off a Concord wagon. Still stamped 'Property of the Still'. I painted a duck over it.",
          "Full Morrow tonight. The orbs hum louder. Probably fine."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:caravan/medic_wagon": {
      "key": "bark:caravan/medic_wagon",
      "id": "bark-caravan-medic-wagon",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:1f6c5c8f65f0ce6a07b2180e8ece1c621094def0cf736c32ef07d920dea884df",
      "about": [
        "character-sister-ilsabet"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "character-sister-ilsabet"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "character-sister-ilsabet",
        "context": "caravan: Medic Wagon",
        "lines": [
          "Bandages boiled, cots aired. Try to come back in one piece anyway.",
          "If it stings, it's working. If it doesn't sting, come see me.",
          "I took vows at a Still once. Turns out the vow was the bandages, not the singing."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:caravan/quartermaster_ledger": {
      "key": "bark:caravan/quartermaster_ledger",
      "id": "bark-caravan-quartermaster-ledger",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:907986fc6e2e171ff62ae5df8edefb5fb1b795128aa293767057c7fbc01dad70",
      "about": [
        "character-osk"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "character-osk"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "character-osk",
        "context": "caravan: Quartermaster's Ledger",
        "lines": [
          "Three iron ore, one wolf pelt, half a cog. It's all in the book.",
          "The Concord kept a ledger too. Ours adds up. That's the difference.",
          "If it isn't in the ledger, it didn't happen. If it is, it's mine to sort."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:caravan/scouts": {
      "key": "bark:caravan/scouts",
      "id": "bark-caravan-scouts",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:0a3036088508ea49ff873cdf668c4aa33a1adac544c900b9402bd250c3a57324",
      "about": [
        "character-wren-and-dace"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "character-wren-and-dace"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "character-wren-and-dace",
        "context": "caravan: Scouts",
        "lines": [
          "Tracks up ahead. Big ones. Wren says small ones. Wren is wrong.",
          "We ride out at first light and come back before the soup's gone.",
          "White domes off the east road. We went the long way round. You're welcome."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:caravan/strongbox": {
      "key": "bark:caravan/strongbox",
      "id": "bark-caravan-strongbox",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:612af90921ad82ba284d93bc6cb10a6a229a2fb6d3db996a4bcc67d7a9172b65",
      "about": [
        "character-penny-tallow"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "character-penny-tallow"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "character-penny-tallow",
        "context": "caravan: Strongbox",
        "lines": [
          "Count twice, spend once. That's not a saying, that's a rule.",
          "The box is locked. The key is somewhere the Concord's auditors never thought to look.",
          "Finish the whole road and I'll show you what a bonus looks like."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/courier/pitch": {
      "key": "bark:merc/courier/pitch",
      "id": "bark-merc-courier-pitch",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:493d1cceaac1686dc3402aa856a8e827d8094204f697e5641181ddb24623d55b",
      "about": [
        "class-courier"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-courier"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-courier",
        "context": "mercenary pitch",
        "lines": [
          "Fastest legs in the underspire. I run orders, I run checkpoints, and I run the price up if you dawdle."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/courier/renewal": {
      "key": "bark:merc/courier/renewal",
      "id": "bark-merc-courier-renewal",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:c69bb4d511644b5c90619001b234100801f93060ef811971f00f969d446a69a9",
      "about": [
        "class-courier"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-courier"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-courier",
        "context": "mercenary renewal",
        "lines": [
          "Last run on this contract. Fast legs don't stay unclaimed long, so make me an offer or I'm gone."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/doctor/pitch": {
      "key": "bark:merc/doctor/pitch",
      "id": "bark-merc-doctor-pitch",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:701102b667c062b5f0f88e3f27509643ac7c1625f4149803b626e0e02b21a8aa",
      "about": [
        "class-doctor"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-doctor"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-doctor",
        "context": "mercenary pitch",
        "lines": [
          "I set bones and sit with the Hollow until they stop wandering, and I don't charge extra for screaming. Contract's by the battle."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/doctor/renewal": {
      "key": "bark:merc/doctor/renewal",
      "id": "bark-merc-doctor-renewal",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:8aac00fba6d9d9d00bb035fd027c2171d51c8a71a2a581b152c7ff0b0c2dfa87",
      "about": [
        "class-doctor"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-doctor"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-doctor",
        "context": "mercenary renewal",
        "lines": [
          "One battle left on my ledger. I've grown used to patching this lot. Shall we write another page?"
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/myrmidon/pitch": {
      "key": "bark:merc/myrmidon/pitch",
      "id": "bark-merc-myrmidon-pitch",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:67c996572f2e515bafc6233eb47138acd199a49e09db7371169b1cf6bd1a4372",
      "about": [
        "class-myrmidon"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-myrmidon"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-myrmidon",
        "context": "mercenary pitch",
        "lines": [
          "I hold a line. You pay me by the fight, not by the hour, and I swear on my shield I don't ask which hold you've robbed."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/myrmidon/renewal": {
      "key": "bark:merc/myrmidon/renewal",
      "id": "bark-merc-myrmidon-renewal",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:7336423f639cee33f7ca0d9b41b95f2a5178f9018bd43a8a0c6abe839c0bf930",
      "about": [
        "class-myrmidon"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-myrmidon"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-myrmidon",
        "context": "mercenary renewal",
        "lines": [
          "One more fight on the books and my shield's my own again. Want it for longer, or do we shake hands here?"
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/prizefighter/pitch": {
      "key": "bark:merc/prizefighter/pitch",
      "id": "bark-merc-prizefighter-pitch",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:e2933cc135d1795835a81a76e8fe82554d11567690288b63c1f0f4a65365fe3f",
      "about": [
        "class-prizefighter"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-prizefighter"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-prizefighter",
        "context": "mercenary pitch",
        "lines": [
          "Undefeated in three pit towns and two the Concord shut down. Champions cost champion money."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/prizefighter/renewal": {
      "key": "bark:merc/prizefighter/renewal",
      "id": "bark-merc-prizefighter-renewal",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:1feeec2fb4d5ff52bc4cd8de1f575f487d66483b8a71280bf47be69643fb0ebb",
      "about": [
        "class-prizefighter"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-prizefighter"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-prizefighter",
        "context": "mercenary renewal",
        "lines": [
          "Last bout on the card, boss. Champions get re-signed or they get scouted. Your call."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/raider/pitch": {
      "key": "bark:merc/raider/pitch",
      "id": "bark-merc-raider-pitch",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:56cf4376853c9d692fe2d59e4763e067b991b0b4496520375e9cabef388f2bbb",
      "about": [
        "class-raider"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-raider"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-raider",
        "context": "mercenary pitch",
        "lines": [
          "Coin up front and I'll ride wherever the wagons roll. I've dodged worse than tithe-wardens."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/raider/renewal": {
      "key": "bark:merc/raider/renewal",
      "id": "bark-merc-raider-renewal",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:38ca55041d7856a678cca2eeafe1679413fd47eac3d95166cf0a6c86bf8dd626",
      "about": [
        "class-raider"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-raider"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-raider",
        "context": "mercenary renewal",
        "lines": [
          "Contract's nearly spent. I'm easy either way, but I'd ride on with you if the purse is there."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/ritualist/pitch": {
      "key": "bark:merc/ritualist/pitch",
      "id": "bark-merc-ritualist-pitch",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:eeea3ffc591525470e7c7a82ea943aac47ac4d1d36ae27f6fdd12444ea6da66d",
      "about": [
        "class-ritualist"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-ritualist"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-ritualist",
        "context": "mercenary pitch",
        "lines": [
          "My circles still answer me, even this close to a Still. That is rarer than you think, and priced to match."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:merc/ritualist/renewal": {
      "key": "bark:merc/ritualist/renewal",
      "id": "bark-merc-ritualist-renewal",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:cad589303e529a486c0d99cb230df7a1773d8c7e62763b1533df89428d00ce63",
      "about": [
        "class-ritualist"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-ritualist"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-ritualist",
        "context": "mercenary renewal",
        "lines": [
          "My circles run dry after one more working. Renew the pact, or let it lapse cleanly. Lapsed pacts never sour."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:surprise/cityruins-03/3": {
      "key": "bark:surprise/cityruins-03/3",
      "id": "bark-surprise-cityruins-03-3",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:61c7a0427274b4749d437c944fc93209a5821a71d7796c17be33525d66741aca",
      "about": [
        "class-demonlord",
        "place-cityruins-03"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-demonlord"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-demonlord",
        "context": "surprise wave",
        "lines": [
          "Your struggle amuses me. Let's end this quickly."
        ]
      }
    },
    "bark:surprise/greenvalley-01/3": {
      "key": "bark:surprise/greenvalley-01/3",
      "id": "bark-surprise-greenvalley-01-3",
      "guid": null,
      "version": 0,
      "source": "seed",
      "hash": "sha256:3c8b7f841c4513506a97ab8565d8f0a12dbb68908899f7f14701b315968206bf",
      "about": [
        "class-captain",
        "place-greenvalley-01"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "class-captain"
      ],
      "payload": {
        "speaker": "class-captain",
        "context": "surprise wave",
        "lines": [
          "Imperial scum! Exterminate every last one of them!"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
